&lt;h1 class="relative group">Three Types of People
&lt;div id="three-types-of-people" class="anchor">&lt;/div>
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100">
&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700"
style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#three-types-of-people" aria-label="Anchor">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>In our personal, social, political, and spiritual lives, there are broadly three kinds of people.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>These levels are not fixed. They change from situation to situation, and from one part of life to another. The same person can be the first kind at work, the second kind in politics, and the third kind in faith. Each kind meets suffering and joy in a different way.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>